      <p class="ListParagraph" style="text-align:justify;margin-left:0.5in"><span style="font-weight:bold;font-family:'Book Antiqua';color:#000000">Decision: </span><span style="font-family:'Book Antiqua';color:#000000">Pursuant to Rule 8(1) of </span><span style="font-style:italic;font-family:'Book Antiqua';color:#000000">The Tribunal Procedure (First-tier Tribunal)(General Regulatory Chamber) Rules 2009</span><span style="font-family:'Book Antiqua';color:#000000">, the application is struck out in its entirety.</span></p>
